---
import SlideChrome from '../SlideChrome.astro';
---

<SlideChrome>
	<div class="flex h-full flex-col">
		<h2 class="pitch-title">Visual Identity</h2>
		<p class="pitch-subtitle">Bright anime school life collapses into supernatural panic.</p>
		<div class="mt-auto max-w-[42rem] space-y-4 pb-1">
			<p class="pitch-body">Day: playful school life, club energy, students, rumors, preparation.</p>
			<p class="pitch-body">Night: warped halls, anomalies, wrong rooms, yokai intrusion, panic.</p>
			<p class="pitch-body">
				The brand contrast is simple: the team starts confident in a familiar school, then watches that school become
				hostile.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</SlideChrome>
